<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="bsc-salesperson" name="BSC salesperson flow"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1250" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="BSC AI Salesperson: how one customer message flows through the system (current design)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="12" width="1500" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sub" value="Read it left to right along the top row, then follow the numbers (1-9). Dashed lines = data being read or saved." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="46" width="1500" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="front" value="Customer's browser (/chat)&lt;br&gt;sends {message, conversation_id}&lt;br&gt;and reads the reply as a live stream" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="90" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="route" value="Server entry&lt;br&gt;checks the request is valid,&lt;br&gt;streams events back" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="90" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="load" value="1. Load the customer&lt;br&gt;last 10 messages, customer profile&lt;br&gt;(who it's for, skin type, budget),&lt;br&gt;products already shown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="90" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prep" value="2. Prepare the instructions&lt;br&gt;detect language (English / Hinglish / Hindi)&lt;br&gt;salesperson rules + live catalog summary&lt;br&gt;+ profile + shown products" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="90" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="policy" value="3. Policy shortcut&lt;br&gt;message mentions refund, return, shipping,&lt;br&gt;cancel, tracking...? Fetch the policy&lt;br&gt;text first and hand it to the assistant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="90" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="degraded" value="No AI model available&lt;br&gt;(all rate-limited)&lt;br&gt;search only: product cards within&lt;br&gt;the stated budget + short apology" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="250" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="models" value="AI model line-up (automatic fallback)&lt;br&gt;1 Groq gpt-oss-120b  2 Groq qwen3.8-27b&lt;br&gt;3 Groq gpt-oss-20b  4 Mistral&lt;br&gt;skips a rate-limited or glitching model" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="250" width="320" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="agent" value="4. Salesperson assistant (AI, streamed)&lt;br&gt;reads chat + profile, decides what to look up,&lt;br&gt;then writes the reply word by word:&lt;br&gt;1 pick, why it fits, 1 trade-off, 1 question max" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="250" width="260" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="runner" value="5. Run the look-ups (plain code)&lt;br&gt;all requested tools run at the same time&lt;br&gt;up to 4 rounds, results kept compact" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="250" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="grp" value="Tools the assistant can call (plain code)" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="195" width="520" height="255" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="search products&lt;br&gt;meaning + keyword search, budget, in-stock first, no duplicates" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="235" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="get product&lt;br&gt;full facts of one product (features, how to use, FAQs)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="287" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t3" value="compare products&lt;br&gt;2-3 products by name; the table is built in code" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="339" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t4" value="search knowledge&lt;br&gt;shipping / returns / refund policy, grooming guides" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="391" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t5" value="get offers&lt;br&gt;biggest real discounts, in stock (no invented coupons)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1555" y="235" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t6" value="build routine&lt;br&gt;ordered steps, computed total, add-all + checkout link" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1555" y="287" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t7" value="hand off to human&lt;br&gt;prefilled support form for complaints" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1555" y="339" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t8" value="remember&lt;br&gt;save / correct what we know about the customer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1555" y="391" width="240" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="guard" value="6. Accuracy checker (plain rules, no AI)&lt;br&gt;prices, links, emails, product names,&lt;br&gt;out-of-stock wording, order-status claims,&lt;br&gt;medical promises, 'free shipping' needs a policy lookup&lt;br&gt;problem found = one rewrite, then the bad sentence is removed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="420" width="260" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="safety" value="7. Safety nets (plain rules)&lt;br&gt;complaint words (damaged, wrong item, refund)&lt;br&gt;= prefilled support form&lt;br&gt;bleeding / severe symptoms = dermatologist line&lt;br&gt;internal tool names never shown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="420" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="build" value="8. Build the response (plain code)&lt;br&gt;cards = products named in the reply, from database rows&lt;br&gt;cards over the stated budget are dropped&lt;br&gt;comparison table; routine card with total + cart link&lt;br&gt;support form; quick-reply chips" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="580" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="save" value="9. Save and log&lt;br&gt;chat + updated profile + products shown&lt;br&gt;log the turn: tools used, speed, model,&lt;br&gt;products shown, searches that found nothing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="610" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="final" value="Reply events to the browser&lt;br&gt;status text, live words, final reply&lt;br&gt;(with cards, table, routine, form, chips)&lt;br&gt;the words appear while step 4 is writing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="580" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cache" value="In-memory catalog&lt;br&gt;217 live products&lt;br&gt;reloaded every 2 min" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="500" width="160" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="embed" value="Mistral embeddings&lt;br&gt;turns a search into numbers&lt;br&gt;(meaning search)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470" y="500" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pg" value="Neon Postgres + pgvector&lt;br&gt;products, search vectors,&lt;br&gt;chats and profiles,&lt;br&gt;turn logs, click events" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="600" width="200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="feed" value="Live BSC store feed&lt;br&gt;price, stock, new and removed products" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="860" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="refresh" value="Catalog refresh (one command)&lt;br&gt;keeps stored ratings and how-to text,&lt;br&gt;marks removed products, embeds only changes,&lt;br&gt;writes a change report" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="860" width="270" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="events" value="Browser reports clicks&lt;br&gt;product click, add to cart,&lt;br&gt;chip tap, checkout" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="860" width="220" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stats" value="Owner stats&lt;br&gt;counts what customers ask, searches that&lt;br&gt;found nothing, recommended vs clicked vs carted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="860" width="260" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="admin" value="Owner page (/admin)&lt;br&gt;insights, speed, catalog freshness" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="860" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&lt;br&gt;Orange = AI model&lt;br&gt;Blue = plain code (no AI)&lt;br&gt;Green = stored data / memory&lt;br&gt;Red = fallback when no AI is available&lt;br&gt;Purple = entry, exit and the owner page&lt;br&gt;Dashed grey = data read or saved" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1020" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="changes" value="What changed compared with the old design&lt;br&gt;1. No more category sorting: one assistant decides what to look up, so follow-ups ('cheaper', 'for my dad') keep the context.&lt;br&gt;2. 2 AI calls per message instead of 3-5, on faster models, with the look-ups running in parallel.&lt;br&gt;3. Live catalog (217 products) held in memory instead of an August snapshot read from the database on every search.&lt;br&gt;4. Words stream to the screen while the reply is written, with progress text.&lt;br&gt;5. Cards and routine totals are built from database rows; a rule-based checker, not another AI call, verifies the reply.&lt;br&gt;6. Several AI models in a line-up, and a no-AI fallback that still shows real product cards.&lt;br&gt;7. Every message is logged, and the owner page shows what customers ask and do." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="1020" width="820" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="example" value="Example: 'bhai beard trimmer chahiye, 1500 tak'&lt;br&gt;1 loads the customer (new chat, empty profile)  2 detects Hinglish  3 no policy words, skipped&lt;br&gt;4 the assistant asks for a search 'beard trimmer', budget 1500, and notes the budget&lt;br&gt;5 the search runs: meaning + words, under 1500, in stock first&lt;br&gt;4 the assistant writes the pick in Hinglish, with a reason and a trade-off&lt;br&gt;6 checks every price and name  7 no complaint words  8 builds the card from the database&lt;br&gt;9 saves the chat and the budget for the next message" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="1020" width="630" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="front" target="route"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="route" target="load"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="load" target="prep"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="policy-type question" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prep" target="policy"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="everything else" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.35;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prep" target="agent"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="policy text added" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.85;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="policy" target="agent"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="tool calls" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="agent" target="runner"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="results" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="runner" target="agent"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="asks the model" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="agent" target="models"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="all models down" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="models" target="degraded"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="cards still shown" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#b85450;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="degraded" target="final"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=bl